   'An elegant challah knife, silver 925 plated, in a delicate classic design with a decorated handle and a sparkling crystal band at the end. The blade carries the words “Shabbat Kodesh”, giving the Shabbat table a festive, uplifting touch. A quality piece for every Shabbat and holiday meal, and a perfect gift for a Jewish home.',
